WEBVTT

00:06.110 --> 00:15.240
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
<b>We're All Having a Party</b>

01:38.460 --> 01:39.580
What?!

01:45.680 --> 01:47.590
Don't tell me...

01:48.200 --> 01:51.690
None of my attacks work on it?!

02:11.480 --> 02:13.780
<i>The last one I shot was a homing bullet.</i>

02:13.780 --> 02:16.150
<i>All of my special bullets have 
gone right through it now.</i>

02:31.920 --> 02:33.650
<i>Even fusion bullets don't work.</i>

02:33.650 --> 02:36.000
<i>It's both faster and stronger than me.</i>

02:36.000 --> 02:37.830
<i>So I have no way to win!</i>

02:38.100 --> 02:41.580
<i>But that doesn't mean I can just give up!</i>

02:46.750 --> 02:47.930
What?

02:52.700 --> 02:53.880
<i>That's...</i>

02:55.550 --> 02:56.780
Of course!

03:10.000 --> 03:11.030
Yes!

03:21.810 --> 03:23.970
When you attack,

03:23.970 --> 03:27.440
the body part you attack 
with becomes corporeal.

03:29.800 --> 03:32.970
The bullet you pulled out of 
your foot a minute ago...

03:33.260 --> 03:34.890
was a homing bullet.

03:35.230 --> 03:40.450
And its homing capabilities kicked 
in the instant it became corporeal.

03:41.870 --> 03:43.650
Once I figured that out,

03:43.650 --> 03:47.330
I just had to fire more homing bullets.
 It didn't matter where.

03:47.330 --> 03:50.430
They'd always react to 
your attacks and hit you.

03:53.830 --> 03:56.060
I'm out of homing bullets,

03:56.060 --> 03:58.620
but now that I've shaved down 
your speed and power,

03:58.620 --> 04:01.100
you're much closer to my level!

04:01.890 --> 04:03.550
And if our strength is equal...

04:04.230 --> 04:06.480
I'm the one who'll win!

04:27.850 --> 04:29.210
Yoda!

04:30.870 --> 04:33.440
Yoda! Yoda!

04:34.080 --> 04:36.540
Yoda! Are you all right?

04:36.540 --> 04:37.810
Emily...

04:38.240 --> 04:40.390
You came here looking for me?

04:40.390 --> 04:42.080
Ow...

04:42.470 --> 04:44.470
You're injured all over!

04:44.470 --> 04:48.380
A healing bullet will fix me right up.

05:14.390 --> 05:17.940
I guess I needed you to save me again.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.730
What are you talking about?

05:22.060 --> 05:24.520
Items are dropping in dungeons again.

05:24.770 --> 05:29.350
You've saved everyone in Secro, Yoda.

05:30.520 --> 05:31.440
But...

05:33.540 --> 05:37.970
Even if it's to help people, I wish 
you wouldn't push yourself so hard.

05:40.670 --> 05:43.370
You always try too hard.

05:44.240 --> 05:49.270
Even if you can be healed, 
getting injured still hurts!

05:49.270 --> 05:51.230
Thanks, Emily.

05:51.230 --> 05:55.280
But I wasn't even thinking 
about saving the town.

05:55.850 --> 05:58.430
I just started running here 
without even realizing it.

05:58.800 --> 06:01.230
I don't want you to push yourself too hard,

06:01.230 --> 06:04.540
but I forgot that's just how you are.

06:06.100 --> 06:08.270
Pushing myself was worth it.

06:09.010 --> 06:13.240
Now you can make 
bean sprout soup for me again.

06:13.240 --> 06:16.250
Yes, I'll go home and make some.

06:24.660 --> 06:27.560
Is this what the dungeon master dropped?

06:27.560 --> 06:29.770
When this ring is equipped...

06:36.210 --> 06:42.370
I want to tell everyone in town 
right away that you fixed the problem.

06:42.370 --> 06:46.160
Nah, I don't like attracting 
too much attention.

06:46.160 --> 06:48.260
Besides, like I said before,

06:48.260 --> 06:51.950
I didn't do it to save the town. 
It was... well...

06:51.950 --> 06:53.330
Ryota!

06:56.010 --> 06:58.580
Don't go off into danger alone!

06:58.580 --> 07:00.440
Let me help you!

07:01.370 --> 07:03.980
Sorry. I'll do that from now on.

07:03.980 --> 07:08.890
It didn't seem like one that would 
become a new friend for me.

07:08.890 --> 07:12.180
Nope, not that one. Try something else.

07:12.180 --> 07:14.700
I haven't had enough of your carrots!

07:14.700 --> 07:18.750
Okay, okay. I'll stop by 
Telulu on the way home.

07:18.750 --> 07:20.320
I'll go, too!

07:20.320 --> 07:21.820
Then, so will I.

07:21.820 --> 07:23.490
Carrots! Quick!

07:23.490 --> 07:25.170
We'll all go together!

07:28.560 --> 07:33.550
<i>This is probably the reason 
I couldn't give up.</i>

07:37.930 --> 07:40.850
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

07:40.850 --> 07:43.520
The dungeon master's drop...

07:43.520 --> 07:48.460
If the description I heard yesterday 
is true, it's incredibly powerful.

08:04.340 --> 08:06.320
And that's ten.

08:06.320 --> 08:08.260
Hey, Mr. Sato!

08:13.220 --> 08:15.910
Hey, working hard again today, huh?

08:15.910 --> 08:18.260
G-Good morning.

08:18.260 --> 08:22.470
You know, that idea you had 
about selling rings...

08:22.470 --> 08:24.610
I don't think it's gonna work for a while.

08:24.610 --> 08:26.770
It means dragons are our main target,

08:27.140 --> 08:30.460
and our princess can't finish 
one of those off alone.

08:30.460 --> 08:32.660
Well, yeah, I guess not.

08:32.660 --> 08:36.150
Even though her level is high...

08:36.150 --> 08:37.580
Is she?

08:37.580 --> 08:42.160
Her maximum level is 99, 
and she's level 94 now.

08:42.430 --> 08:44.610
She'll reach 95 soon.

08:44.610 --> 08:45.470
Huh?

08:50.750 --> 08:52.530
See? It's just as I said.

08:50.750 --> 08:52.710
<b>"Margaret"
Level 94/99
Status
HP:               F
MP:               F
Strength:      F
Vitality:        F
Intelligence: F
Will:             F</b>

08:52.530 --> 08:53.620
Yeah...

08:52.710 --> 08:56.180
<b>"Margaret"
Level 94/99
Drop Status
Plants:      F
Animals:  F
Minerals: F
Magic:      F
Specials:   F</b>

08:56.170 --> 09:00.210
<i>So even though her level keeps 
going up, her abilities don't.</i>

09:00.210 --> 09:04.430
<i>It's gotta suck when none of the 
work you put in ever pays off.</i>

09:05.380 --> 09:06.590
Give me your hand.

09:08.170 --> 09:09.640
Like this?

09:13.580 --> 09:15.630
I leveled up!

09:15.630 --> 09:16.990
Huh?!

09:16.990 --> 09:21.320
<i>A ring that turns any experience gained 
after maxing out your level into a crystal.</i>

09:21.930 --> 09:26.530
<i>I couldn't quite believe it, 
but now I know it works.</i>

09:26.530 --> 09:27.430
What?!

09:28.040 --> 09:29.250
What is it?

09:29.250 --> 09:32.080
They've gone up... They've gone up!

09:32.080 --> 09:34.010
Huh?!

09:32.090 --> 09:34.010
<b>"Margaret"
Level 95/99
Drop Status
Plants:     E
Animals:  E
Minerals: E
Magic:     E
Specials:  E</b>

09:34.010 --> 09:38.270
That's awesome! All your 
hard work is... paying...

09:38.690 --> 09:42.160
Wait, hang on. Give me your hand again.

09:42.160 --> 09:43.300
Okay...

09:46.980 --> 09:49.230
I leveled up again!

09:49.230 --> 09:51.020
What?!

09:49.230 --> 09:52.650
<b>"Margaret"
Level 96/99
Drop Status
Plants:      D
Animals:  D
Minerals: D
Magic:     D
Specials:  D</b>

09:51.020 --> 09:52.650
I knew it!

09:52.650 --> 09:54.200
You knew what?!

09:54.200 --> 09:56.900
The princess is a majorly late bloomer.

09:56.900 --> 10:00.780
Her drop rates hit E at level 95,
 and D at level 96.

10:00.780 --> 10:03.000
So when she reaches
 level 99, they'll all be A!

10:03.000 --> 10:04.150
I'm sure of it!

10:04.890 --> 10:07.990
Long live Princess Margaret!

10:08.000 --> 10:12.380
So everything I've done 
really hasn't been a waste.

10:12.380 --> 10:15.450
You taught me that.

10:15.450 --> 10:18.010
Nah, I wanted to try those 
things out, anyway.

10:18.580 --> 10:24.620
Remember when I asked you to accept 
my first ring the last time we met?

10:24.620 --> 10:25.710
Well...

10:26.190 --> 10:31.490
I'd really like it if you would 
accept all of my firsts.

10:31.490 --> 10:35.730
Nah, it wouldn't be right 
for me to take that much.

10:35.730 --> 10:39.300
Well, there's something
 I wanna do. See ya later.

10:40.620 --> 10:44.520
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

10:44.800 --> 10:47.220
I hit up all the greengrocers in town

10:47.220 --> 10:49.950
and bought all the bean sprouts 
and carrots they had.

10:50.220 --> 10:53.120
I'm going to get all of us leveled up.

10:53.120 --> 10:58.540
Um... Do you mean we're going to turn all of 
these into strays and kill them together?

10:58.540 --> 11:01.470
I have an even more efficient way.

11:02.060 --> 11:07.400
This turns leftover experience into 
crystals that I can give to others.

11:07.400 --> 11:10.430
Is that what the dungeon master
 dropped yesterday?

11:10.430 --> 11:13.110
Is that really possible?

11:13.110 --> 11:16.440
Yeah. Alice has maxed out her level,

11:16.440 --> 11:18.510
so that leaves Emily, 
Celeste, and Eve, right?

11:18.510 --> 11:21.650
Mine's maxed out, too. More importantly...

11:23.780 --> 11:25.960
Carrots are for eating.

11:25.960 --> 11:32.050
Eve, if you'll just be patient, 
Yoda will give you even tastier carrots.

11:32.050 --> 11:35.630
Y-Yeah, that's right. I will.

11:38.040 --> 11:41.090
Okay. I'll be patient.

11:41.090 --> 11:43.080
Well, let's get started, then.

11:49.380 --> 11:52.930
The regular bullets they drop 
go in my pouch automatically,

11:52.930 --> 11:54.630
so I won't run out.

11:55.570 --> 11:58.730
Emily and Celeste, 
take turns picking them up!

12:02.010 --> 12:04.700
Oh! I leveled up!

12:04.700 --> 12:08.270
He's totally perfected this whole process.

12:08.270 --> 12:11.020
He's the very image of a 
first-class adventurer.

12:11.380 --> 12:17.050
Did I just... join the party 
of someone genuinely amazing?

12:17.050 --> 12:19.590
Yoda really is incredible!

12:19.590 --> 12:21.270
You're amazing, Ryota!

12:21.270 --> 12:22.900
That's our Ryota!

12:22.900 --> 12:25.110
Amazing, Yoda!

12:29.430 --> 12:32.410
Wow! My level's maxed out!

12:32.410 --> 12:34.540
And my vitality went up to A, too!

12:32.480 --> 12:35.350
<b>"Emily"
Level 40/40
Status
HP: A
MP: F</b>

12:35.350 --> 12:44.780
<b>HP:              A
MP:              F
Strength:     A
Vitality:       A
Intelligence: F
Will:             F
Speed:          E
Dexterity:    E
Luck:           B</b>

12:36.480 --> 12:38.740
One of your drop rates 
went up a little, too.

12:38.740 --> 12:40.270
Yes!

12:40.270 --> 12:42.580
It's your turn next, Celeste.

12:44.780 --> 12:45.320
<b>"Emily"
Level 40/40
Drop Status
Plants: D
Animals: E</b>

12:45.320 --> 12:48.700
<b>"Celeste" 
Level 54/54 
Status 
HP:          D 
MP:         A 
Strength: E 
Vitality:   E</b>

12:46.050 --> 12:48.700
Your MP is at rank A now!

12:55.370 --> 12:58.290
<b>Drop Status 
Plants:      F 
Animals:  F 
Minerals: F 
Magic:     E 
Specials:  F</b>

12:58.740 --> 13:01.070
You're not an F Final anymore.

13:01.070 --> 13:02.360
Thank you!

13:02.360 --> 13:04.590
Thank you from me, too.

13:04.590 --> 13:10.560
But it's a little sad that you're 
not getting any experience

13:10.560 --> 13:12.380
when you're working so hard.

13:12.380 --> 13:14.640
Nope, I'm getting experience.

13:15.370 --> 13:17.410
It's just not expressed as a number.

13:17.410 --> 13:21.580
I've gained a lot through 
my experiences in this world.

13:22.330 --> 13:28.500
And now I have an item that lets me use all that 
I've built up to share experience with you guys.

13:28.500 --> 13:29.990
Yoda...

13:29.990 --> 13:33.490
Anyway, now that we've all 
maxed out our levels,

13:33.490 --> 13:37.200
I guess the Ryota Family is ready 
to move on to the next stage!

13:37.200 --> 13:38.460
Yeah!

13:39.390 --> 13:41.420
Next carrot?

13:44.050 --> 13:49.050
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:44.050 --> 13:49.050
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:44.270 --> 13:46.390
It's all you now! Go, Emily!

13:46.390 --> 13:48.460
Uh... Yay!

13:49.050 --> 13:54.060
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:49.050 --> 13:54.060
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:49.490 --> 13:50.780
And now...

13:50.780 --> 13:52.380
A word from the director!

13:58.910 --> 14:01.480
So that's the Ryota Family?

14:01.480 --> 14:04.810
They only just got together, 
but they're on fire.

14:05.290 --> 14:09.790
The one with the hammer, Emily, 
has a merchant who provides her weapons.

14:10.800 --> 14:15.380
The pretty magic user, Celeste, 
also excels in intel gathering.

14:16.050 --> 14:18.950
They've even tamed the Killing Rabbit.

14:18.950 --> 14:23.870
And I heard the new girl they just 
took in can command monsters!

14:24.380 --> 14:29.300
That Sato Ryota guy's pulled 
together quite a crew.

14:30.310 --> 14:33.340
But as long as just one of us has a license,

14:33.340 --> 14:37.150
no one else going into a dungeon 
with them needs one, right?

14:37.150 --> 14:41.350
Yeah, but if you do have one, 
it could come in handy someday.

14:41.350 --> 14:43.760
Besides, the more members 
we have with licenses,

14:43.760 --> 14:46.230
the stronger our family will look.

14:46.230 --> 14:49.580
And it'll be easier to get 
quests if we need them.

14:49.580 --> 14:55.320
Today, we'll be getting licenses for Emily and 
Celeste to go below the fifth level of Telulu.

14:55.870 --> 14:59.450
With your skills, it shouldn't be a problem.

14:59.720 --> 15:02.800
Alice, this will be a lesson to prepare 
you to get your own license someday.

15:02.800 --> 15:03.580
And Eve—

15:03.580 --> 15:06.750
I have a license. 
I'm waiting for your carrots.

15:06.750 --> 15:09.390
Oh, right. Got it.

15:12.050 --> 15:14.460
I can definitely tell 
they're with you, my man!

15:14.780 --> 15:16.880
They both pass with flying colors!

15:20.770 --> 15:23.440
We've all maxed out our levels now,

15:23.440 --> 15:27.120
and Emily and Celeste have their licenses.

15:27.120 --> 15:30.230
I think our family's in 
a good place right now.

15:30.230 --> 15:31.520
I agree!

15:31.520 --> 15:33.860
Ryota, what are we gonna do next?

15:34.400 --> 15:37.070
Let's act individually for a while.

15:37.070 --> 15:38.010
What?

15:38.480 --> 15:41.530
We'll head out to separate hunting grounds 
where we can make the most of our talents,

15:41.530 --> 15:42.960
and make the rounds.

15:42.960 --> 15:46.240
I want to get an idea of what 
we can all do around here,

15:46.240 --> 15:49.910
and how much profit 
we can make on average.

15:49.910 --> 15:51.660
I get it now!

15:51.660 --> 15:53.350
That's certainly important.

15:53.670 --> 15:57.490
I'll get you all some potions 
to boost drop rates.

15:57.490 --> 15:59.270
Use them whenever you need.

15:59.270 --> 16:03.480
And even if you don't earn as much 
as you'd like, no working overtime.

16:03.480 --> 16:05.200
There'll be days like that.

16:05.200 --> 16:09.100
We'll do our best to get together 
for lunch and dinner every day.

16:09.100 --> 16:09.830
Dismissed!

16:09.830 --> 16:10.980
Yes, sir!

16:21.230 --> 16:23.440
Okay, let's all announce our results.

16:24.170 --> 16:31.110
My average over six days was the equivalent 
of 120,000 pilos per day, a new record.

16:31.110 --> 16:33.460
Why "the equivalent"?

16:33.460 --> 16:35.100
Because I ate them all.

16:35.100 --> 16:38.770
You ate 120,000 pilos' 
worth times six days?!

16:38.770 --> 16:41.130
I made 160,000 pilos,

16:41.130 --> 16:43.180
also a personal best!

16:43.180 --> 16:48.380
We earned... 215,123 pilos.

16:48.380 --> 16:51.870
That's a little over 100,000 for each of us.

16:51.870 --> 16:56.370
And I made... 1,560,000 pilos.

16:57.790 --> 17:00.450
Which means if we're all together,

17:00.450 --> 17:02.950
we can rake in about two million a day.

17:03.240 --> 17:05.240
I know that for sure now.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.900
Is there something you plan to buy?

17:06.900 --> 17:09.240
Yeah, something I've been putting off.

17:09.240 --> 17:11.830
Magic carts for all of us!

17:16.710 --> 17:18.140
Here goes!

17:25.410 --> 17:27.230
Wow! What just happened?!

17:27.510 --> 17:31.490
Anything that'll fit in the 
magic cart can be sent over.

17:31.490 --> 17:33.620
It's Orton's latest model.

17:36.130 --> 17:38.930
Eve's already mastered hers.

17:39.320 --> 17:41.190
That's very handy.

17:41.620 --> 17:44.650
If one of us gets stuck in a 
dungeon with a full cart,

17:44.650 --> 17:47.760
we can keep hunting instead 
of returning to town.

17:48.060 --> 17:51.540
Hey, Ryota... Can I ask one question?

17:51.540 --> 17:52.660
What's up?

17:52.660 --> 17:55.780
How do we get these to the trader?

17:55.780 --> 17:56.670
Uh...

17:58.550 --> 18:00.430
So anyway...

18:00.430 --> 18:03.030
If we gather everything 
together at home first,

18:03.030 --> 18:07.230
we'll probably still have to make 
multiple trips between there and here.

18:07.230 --> 18:11.690
Just a day's worth of your own 
trips here is already amazing.

18:11.690 --> 18:16.240
Your record so far is sixteen trips!

18:16.240 --> 18:18.040
I'm impressed you remember that.

18:18.040 --> 18:20.820
Only because it's you, Mr. Sato.

18:21.380 --> 18:23.850
Go do your own work, Eyna!

18:23.850 --> 18:24.860
Yeah, yeah.

18:25.160 --> 18:31.740
M-More importantly, you'll continue to 
do all your business with us, right?

18:31.740 --> 18:34.960
Yeah. You've done so much for me.

18:34.960 --> 18:37.560
I came to talk about this because 
I want to keep that going.

18:37.910 --> 18:39.220
All right.

18:39.720 --> 18:41.500
I'll talk to the owner.

18:42.710 --> 18:44.050
So there you have it.

18:44.650 --> 18:48.710
Erza's going to work exclusively 
for us from now on.

18:49.170 --> 18:51.160
I look forward to it.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.750
So you'll do all the counting here,

18:52.750 --> 18:55.030
and make the arrangements 
to have them collected?

18:55.030 --> 18:56.290
That's wonderful.

18:56.290 --> 18:59.690
And you'll be here every day,
 except for holidays?

18:59.690 --> 19:03.030
You're basically a member 
of the Yoda Family now!

19:03.350 --> 19:06.450
Now we've really got nothing 
left to worry about!

19:06.450 --> 19:08.800
We can all go hunt to our hearts' content!

19:08.800 --> 19:10.380
Yeah!

19:10.730 --> 19:12.080
<i>I think...</i>

19:12.080 --> 19:16.730
<i>I'm really glad I was sent 
here from my old world.</i>

19:17.600 --> 19:20.600
This is a welcome party for Erza, right?

19:20.950 --> 19:23.450
I get why Eyna's here. But...

19:23.450 --> 19:26.400
Why are you here?

19:26.400 --> 19:30.170
I've been wanting to come 
and see your house.

19:30.170 --> 19:33.150
Don't show up when you weren't invited!

19:33.150 --> 19:35.290
You even brought your partymates!

19:35.290 --> 19:37.250
What's the problem?

19:37.250 --> 19:41.930
Yoda, more people make a party more fun!

19:41.930 --> 19:45.480
See? You heard your partner.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.870
That's right!

19:47.120 --> 19:49.540
Jeez... All right, fine.

19:51.570 --> 19:52.650
Yes?

19:52.990 --> 19:54.740
Um, um...

19:54.740 --> 19:58.030
I hadn't thanked you yet for 
last time, so please...

19:58.610 --> 20:01.890
They're just flowers, 
but if you'll accept them...

20:01.890 --> 20:04.420
Oh... Why don't you come in?

20:04.420 --> 20:06.840
We'd love to come in, Mr. Sato!

20:07.230 --> 20:09.650
We had an idea for the 
princess's next new product,

20:09.650 --> 20:11.990
but we wanted your opinion!

20:11.990 --> 20:14.010
Can we save that for next time?

20:14.890 --> 20:18.620
More people make a party more fun!

20:18.620 --> 20:19.990
Thank you for having us.

20:21.450 --> 20:23.850
Yo! How goes it?

20:23.850 --> 20:24.940
Daddy!

20:25.380 --> 20:27.920
You can't just go in without permission!

20:29.280 --> 20:31.070
Come on in!

20:31.070 --> 20:34.180
It'll be more fun with lots of people!

20:35.390 --> 20:38.230
Sato, I brought this to thank you.

20:38.230 --> 20:38.910
Huh?

20:39.350 --> 20:43.770
You're the one who defeated 
the dungeon master, right?

20:44.040 --> 20:45.910
It's a year's supply of sugar cubes.

20:45.910 --> 20:48.530
Don't say anything! Just accept it!

20:48.530 --> 20:50.190
I'd really rather not!

20:52.740 --> 20:54.200
Low-Level!

20:54.530 --> 20:56.390
Not enough carrots.

20:56.390 --> 20:57.810
Ryota!

20:57.810 --> 21:02.390
The ratio of women to men in this 
room is not nearly high enough!

21:03.110 --> 21:04.520
Hey, Ryota!

21:04.520 --> 21:08.620
Bonesy and Jiggly say they 
want to be friends with Olga!

21:10.590 --> 21:13.000
You're all more than welcome!

21:13.000 --> 21:17.150
A lively party with lots of 
people is the most fun of all!

21:20.520 --> 21:22.750
<i>When I came to this world,</i>

21:22.750 --> 21:25.160
<i>I was given a unique skill.</i>

21:25.380 --> 21:27.880
<i>I was incredibly fortunate.</i>

21:29.060 --> 21:32.710
<i>I wonder what the old me 
would think if he saw this.</i>

21:33.410 --> 21:34.250
<i>But...</i>

21:38.510 --> 21:41.140
<i>What makes me even more fortunate is...</i>

21:53.700 --> 21:56.120
It looks like we might not have enough food.

21:56.420 --> 21:59.020
I'll go out to the dungeon and get more.

21:59.020 --> 22:01.360
In that case, we'll go with you!

22:03.130 --> 22:10.050
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>
